  "title": {
    "zh": "Coinbase 获 CFTC 批准注册自有衍生品清算机构",
    "en": "Coinbase Wins CFTC Approval to Register Its Own Derivatives Clearinghouse"
  },
  "current_state": {
    "zh": "Coinbase 获 CFTC 批准注册 Coinbase Clearing LLC 为其自有衍生品清算机构（DCO），该注册已于周一生效，支持原生 USDC 抵押品及 7×24 小时结算，并获准清算全额抵押的期货、期货期权和掉期，但不包括杠杆产品；保证金衍生品及即将推出的个股永续合约仍依赖现有合作伙伴。",
    "en": "Coinbase received CFTC approval to register Coinbase Clearing LLC as its own derivatives clearing organization (DCO); the registration became effective Monday, supporting native USDC collateral and 24/7 settlement, and authorized to clear fully collateralized futures, options on futures, and swaps, but not leveraged products; margined derivatives and upcoming single-stock perpetuals still rely on existing partners."
  },
